        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 386.48,
          "end": 388.57,
          "en": "to turn it into a title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 388.57,
          "end": 393.57,
          "en": "You can also create lists with dashes or with numbers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 393.81,
          "end": 395.43,
          "en": "to have ordered lists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 395.43,
          "end": 398.67,
          "en": "You can add links by putting text in square brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 398.67,
          "end": 402.78,
          "en": "and adding the link destination in parentheses thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 402.78,
          "end": 404.2,
          "en": "things like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 404.2,
          "end": 406.1,
          "en": "If you ever worked with GitHub",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 406.1,
          "end": 409.01,
          "en": "and you added a read me for a GitHub repository,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 409.01,
          "end": 411.74,
          "en": "you wrote that in Markdown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
